    <h3 style="color: #ffffff; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 10px; line-height: 1.4;">Self‑attested RC Photocopy</h3>
    <p style="color: #94a3b8; font-size: 0.88rem; line-height: 1.65; margin: 0;">The registration certificate (RC) of the vehicle that will carry your goods must be scanned and self‑attested. This document confirms the ownership and legal status of the transport vehicle, ensuring the carrier can be held accountable for any mishandling.</p>
  </div>
  <div style="background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.75); border: 1.5px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 14px; padding: 24px 20px; box-shadow: 0 10px 25px rgba(0,0,0,0.35); transition: transform 0.2s ease, border-color 0.2s ease;">
    <div style="display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; width: 42px; height: 42px; border-radius: 10px; background: #10b98122; color: #10b981; font-weight: 800; font-size: 1.05rem; margin-bottom: 14px;">02</div>
    <h3 style="color: #ffffff; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 10px; line-height: 1.4;">Current PUC Certificate</h3>
    <p style="color: #94a3b8; font-size: 0.88rem; line-height: 1.65; margin: 0;">The Pollution Under Control (PUC) certificate proves that the vehicle complies with environmental regulations. A valid PUC is mandatory for all commercial vehicles operating on Indian roads, and its absence can result in fines or refusal of service.</p>
  </div>
  <div style="background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.75); border: 1.5px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 14px; padding: 24px 20px; box-shadow: 0 10px 25px rgba(0,0,0,0.35); transition: transform 0.2s ease, border-color 0.2s ease;">
    <div style="display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; width: 42px; height: 42px; border-radius: 10px; background: #3b82f622; color: #3b82f6; font-weight: 800; font-size: 1.05rem; margin-bottom: 14px;">03</div>
    <h3 style="color: #ffffff; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 10px; line-height: 1.4;">Valid Insurance Certificate</h3>
    <p style="color: #94a3b8; font-size: 0.88rem; line-height: 1.65; margin: 0;">The carrier must supply proof of a comprehensive insurance policy that covers the goods during transit. This certificate is your safety net against loss, damage, or theft.</p>
  </div>
  <div style="background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.75); border: 1.5px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 14px; padding: 24px 20px; box-shadow: 0 10px 25px rgba(0,0,0,0.35); transition: transform 0.2s ease, border-color 0.2s ease;">
    <div style="display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; width: 42px; height: 42px; border-radius: 10px; background: #a855f722; color: #a855f7; font-weight: 800; font-size: 1.05rem; margin-bottom: 14px;">04</div>
    <h3 style="color: #ffffff; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 10px; line-height: 1.4;">IBA‑Approved Consignment Bilty</h3>
    <p style="color: #94a3b8; font-size: 0.88rem; line-height: 1.65; margin: 0;">The Interstate Bulk Consignment (IBA) bilty is the official receipt issued by the transport operator. It details the cargo, route, and handling instructions. An IBA‑approved bilty guarantees that the consignment is tracked and managed under strict regulatory standards.</p>
  </div>
</div>

<p>Among these documents, the <strong>100 % declared‑value marine transit insurance</strong> stands out as the most critical safeguard. Unlike standard policies that offer a percentage of the cargo value, this type of coverage ensures that the full declared value of your goods is protected in case of loss or damage during the marine leg of the journey.</p>
<p>The marine segment often involves the most complex logistics—loading onto a container, shipping across the coast, and transferring to a truck in Bangalore. By declaring the entire value, you eliminate the risk of under‑insurance, which can lead to significant out‑of‑pocket expenses if something goes wrong.</p>

<p>To secure this coverage, work closely with your chosen packer and mover to submit a detailed inventory of all items, including their purchase price or replacement cost. The carrier’s insurance provider will use this data to calculate the premium and issue a certificate that reflects the 100 % coverage.</p>
<p>Remember to keep a copy of every document—especially the bilty and insurance certificate—in a safe place during transit, and verify that they match the shipment details upon arrival in Bangalore.</p>

<p>By ensuring that each of these documents is complete, accurate, and compliant with Indian transport regulations, you can move from Visakhapatnam to Bangalore with confidence, knowing that your belongings are protected from start to finish.</p></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>


